!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Fresh media (DMEM, 10% FBS, 10ng/ml GM-CSF)was prepared every 2 days and compounds were added to the right concentration and 0,01% DMSO
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = OCI-AML1-Cas9 EKO library cells were treated with Doxycyclin (2 ug/mL) for 7 days for Cas9 activation and gene KO. Cells were then split in 6 conditions: DMSO, Um171 250nM, UM171 800nM. Cells were collected every 2 dyas for gDNA extraction and split with fresh media up to 14 days
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Proteinase-K/ammonium acetate/ethanol extraction - in-house protocol
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Illumina index sequencies were added to each sample by PCR (PCR2)
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR screen
!Sample_data_processing = Basecalls performed using Illumina RTA 2.4.11.
!Sample_data_processing = Samples demultiplexed using bcl2fastq 2.20.
!Sample_data_processing = Reads trimmed using Trim Galore 0.5.0
!Sample_data_processing = Reads mapped using Bowtie2 2.3.3.1
!Sample_data_processing = Counts obtained using MAGeCK 0.5.7
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38; the file sgRNA sequences.txt (available on the series record) contains the sgRNA sequence for our CRISPR experiment with columns: A) sgRNA identifier, B) sequence, C) gene or chromosome location.
